Private Mesa 25.2.8, AMD Radeon Graphics (radeonsi, renoir, DRM 3.64).
Patches: mesa-gs-quad-line-experiment.patch,
mesa-gs-unbind-dirty-stage-candidate.patch,
mesa-gs-line-point-combined-after-transition.patch,
mesa-gs-clipdist-varying-after-link.patch.
MESA_EXPERIMENTAL_CLIP_BOUNDARY=1; MESA_GLTHREAD=false;
MESA_SHADER_CACHE_DISABLE=true. MESA_GLSL_DISABLE_IO_OPT unset.

Physical GLX, AMD_DEBUG=nongg: strict oracle exit 0.
Physical GLX, AMD_DEBUG unset: strict oracle exit 0.
